      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Odessa%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When the railroad arrived in the 1880s, the village moved a mile southwest, leaving the original Bonanza post office behind.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Odessa%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Lake Odessa Area Historical Society, located at 1117 Emerson Street, runs a museum and hosts lectures, tours, and special exhibitions.",
